       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- maintain and develop the website;",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- enhance or improve your experience of our website by collecting details of your visit to our websites using cookies and standard weblogs;",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "- enable communication and marketing uses",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "In addition, Aalto will also process personal data for the purposes of data security and to prevent and resolve possible misconduct.",
