      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Personal data is collected from the users themselves during their visits on our website or when they otherwise interact with Aalto. Information about Aalto Community members, employee and student information, is imported to our site from other Aalto data systems, such as Aalto University Active Directory.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Personal data can be collected and updated, if necessary, from Aalto partners and companies or authorities providing services related to personal data, such as companies providing services related to the updating of contact details. This applies mainly to cases where the user has subscribed to our newsletter.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
